{"id":"0e413c8821fc11060fc9483e112c9e60aa114346","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/BBB268wCIfSkzRPY.html","title":"黄仁勋「每天都在用」的 Perplexity 开始重构 Attention，把「判断」做成了一个独立模型 | 雷峰网","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"Decider v1.3：63 项分类任务准确率达 91.6%，对标 Jev 成本直降 61%。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"黄仁勋「每天都在用」的 Perplexity 开始重构 Attention，把「判断」做成了一个独立模型\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafNGPvDtdytruUyBMkLUiaO236GiaOmZr8OiaV42WwHB11EvUdUhFIm3sIetaMsVdxnMRZUibzibDPO2ALRKSvoEdJh9BgW2zBwkrLyQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100265379\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261119/6afebb667efc8.jpg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261119/6afebb667efc8.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Decider v1.3：63 项分类任务准确率达 91.6%，对标 Jev 成本直降 61%。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlb